DESCRIPTION:Tim is uncomfortable both on and off-stage. He's 32 and recentl
 y made the long journey from Brisbane to London\, only to discover that may
 be it's him that's the problem. Mahesh is a 39-year-old Londoner. He's live
 d here most of his life\, but always feels like he's on the outside looking
  in. Together\, they are Awkward and Depressed: two lost souls\, searching 
